# title_stack oracle fixtures — truthy / sanitize / describe / extract / summarize
# \e -> ESC, \n -> newline, \x1e -> RS (SKILL_EXCERPT_JOINT)

# --- is_truthy_value (utils.py) ---
truthy 1 false
truthy true false
truthy TRUE false
truthy  Yes  false
truthy on false
truthy off true
truthy 0 true
truthy no true
truthy __none__ true
truthy __none__ false
truthy garbage true
truthy  false

# --- SessionDB.sanitize_title (hermes_state.py) ---
sanitize hello world
sanitize   spaced   out   title  
sanitize tab\nand newline collapse
sanitize ctrl\x1echars ok
sanitize 
sanitize aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
sanitize héllo wörld — unicode ok 🎉
sanitize a​b‌c‍d
sanitize ‪override‬ text‏

# --- describe_skill_invocation / extract (agent/skill_commands.py) ---
describe plain user message, not scaffolding
extract plain user message, not scaffolding
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "work" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nSKILL BODY HERE\n\nThe user has provided the following instruction alongside the skill invocation: fix the title leak
extract [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "work" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nSKILL BODY HERE\n\nThe user has provided the following instruction alongside the skill invocation: fix the title leak
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "work" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nBODY ONLY, no instruction
extract [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "work" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nBODY ONLY, no instruction
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "/clean /work" skill bundle, loaded below.]\nUser instruction: do   both\t things\n\n[Loaded as part of the "/clean /work" bundle]\nskill body
extract [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "/clean /work" skill bundle, loaded below.]\nUser instruction: do   both\t things\n\n[Loaded as part of the "/clean /work" bundle]\nskill body
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "work" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nThe user has provided the following instruction alongside the skill invocation: head part\x1etail part after joint
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "work" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nThe user has provided the following instruction alongside the skill invocation: \n\n[Runtime note: platform=telegram]
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the "" skill. The full skill content is loaded below.]\n\nThe user has provided the following instruction alongside the skill invocation: nameless instruction
describe [IMPORTANT: The user has invoked the unquoted skill body

